<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="379402100"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:19.000"><div begin="19.884" end="36.740" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="19.884" end="23.670" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.884" end="20.477">找</span><span begin="20.477" end="22.118">一个没有人的</span><span begin="22.118" end="22.943">午夜山</span><span begin="22.943" end="23.670">头</span></p><p begin="24.601" end="27.919" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.601" end="25.990">解开我衣扣</span> <span begin="25.990" end="27.373">让我大声呼</span><span begin="27.373" end="27.919">吼</span></p><p begin="27.929" end="32.354" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.929" end="30.113">就让那强冷的寒风</span> <span begin="30.113" end="30.615">它</span><span begin="30.677" end="31.797">用力吹着</span><span begin="31.797" end="32.354">我</span></p><p begin="33.465" end="36.740" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.465" end="34.809">能不能将你</span><span begin="34.809" end="36.211">从我心中吹</span><span begin="36.211" end="36.740">走</span></p></div><div begin="37.067" end="1:03.901" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="37.067" end="41.099" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.067" end="37.593">但是</span><span begin="37.593" end="37.975">亲</span><span begin="38.152" end="38.700">爱</span><span begin="38.700" end="39.219">的你</span> <span begin="39.219" end="40.593">请你不要忘</span><span begin="40.593" end="41.099">记</span></p><p begin="41.205" end="46.378" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.205" end="43.388">忘记你曾经为我哭</span><span begin="43.388" end="43.919">泣</span> <span begin="43.975" end="44.496">嘿</span><span begin="44.496" end="44.959">荷</span> <span begin="45.082" end="45.628">嘿</span><span begin="45.628" end="46.378">荷</span></p><p begin="46.444" end="49.955" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="46.444" end="46.853">亲</span><span begin="47.034" end="47.527">爱</span><span begin="47.527" end="48.101">的你</span> <span begin="48.101" end="49.487">请你不要忘</span><span begin="4